  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop2Build (D2B)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop2Build offers direct support to government authorities in low income and Dutch partner countries in coverting promising ideas for public infrastructure into viable high impact projects. This support is provided in the form of grants for studies that need to be completed before an infrastructual project can be tendered. Additionally, technical support and capicity building may be offered in the tendering phase, where necessary.</narrative>
  </description>
